{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hollowglass</strong> - Atmospheric first-person horror about the last minutes of survival in the desert, despite all its dangers.<br><br>Try to survive at least one more moment. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of jackals</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of vultures</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of pain</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/Birds.gif?t=1740772650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not <strong>listen to the voice</strong>, do not <strong>slow down</strong>, hold on to the stick as if it were the last thing left of you. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of death</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of snakes</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of the desert</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/extras/Shakal.gif?t=1740772650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not <strong>listen to yourself</strong>, you know the direction, do not stumble and keep moving even when there is nothing left to move with. The source of water is already very close, do not be <strong>afraid of emptiness</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid of it</strong>, do not be <strong>afraid</strong>...<br><br>Features: <br>- Graphics stylized as PS1 <br>- Various dangers <br>- Well-developed artificial intelligence of jackals</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547580?t=1740772650","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547580?t=1740772650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547580/a4d3bae9880b33546356a75523605760ec55ef61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=